# 10. Real site content and personal reference data -- NEVER COMMIT.
# This repository is PUBLIC. These files hold the owner's real CV, academic
# transcript, residency status, contact details and persona profile.
# audit/ is where scripts/export_content.py writes production table dumps.
audit/
# The seed files carrying that data stay on disk for local seeding (the
# loader skips any file that is absent, so a fresh clone still works).
# Only the file with no personal content are committed.
app/models/seed/*.json
!app/models/seed/consent_policy.json